<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.7.9">
<l>vaṭaticai maturai cāḷaki rāmam vaikuntan tuvaraiya yōtti</l>
<l>yiṭamuṭai vatari yiṭavakai yuṭaiya vempuru ṭō ttama ṉirukkai</l>
<l>taṭavarai yatirat taraṇiviṇ ṭiṭiyat talaippaṟṟik karaimarañ cāṭi</l>
<l>kaṭaliṉaik kalaṅkak kaṭuttiḻi kaṅkaik kaṇṭameṉ ṉuṅkaṭi nakarē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The seat of our Puruṣottama</l>
<l rend="indent">who has the places of Madura in the North,</l>
<l rend="indent">Śālagrāma, Vaikuntha, Dvārakā, [and] Ayodhyā.</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] places like Badarī,</l>
<l>is the protected city called Kaṇṭam</l>
<l rend="indent">on the Ganges which descends swiflty to agitate the sea,</l>
<l rend="indent">splitting the earth so [it] crumbles</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] the broad mountains shake,</l>
<l rend="indent">seizing the tops [and] breaking the shore trees.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
